{
 "header": [
  "The page's extended plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, 5 minutes at most, for when a change needs a",
  "longer play than tools/play_plan.json: the launcher, Load ROM",
  "on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind the launcher is done (Firefox builds none there, and its",
  "line saying so is the one waited for), Start Game, the logos and 20 s of the intro, then Start (Enter) to the file",
  "menu, as a player does. A mission is started from there by tools/shader_survey.js as mission select's Accept does",
  "(patches/shader_survey.c), on Agent: making an agent file and going through the Perfect Menu takes the name entry",
  "and a dozen screens a script can't pass reliably. Each mission is behind a need that fails the run unless its stage",
  "is the one playing and Joanna is in control, its opening cutscene skipped with A (Space). She is made invincible",
  "(setInvincible) and plays about 60 s of the game's time: out and back by as much about where the level starts her,",
  "strafing, turning, firing and aiming (R). Its waits and holds are on the game's own clock, g_Vars.lvframe240 (240 a",
  "second), so every browser walks her as far whatever frames it gives the game.",
  "dataDyne Central - Defection, then Carrington Villa (outdoors: its sky, clouds and water, patches/sky.c) and",
  "Chicago, each started from inside the one before by the survey."
